prerequisite order. The three covered cash-flow objectives are excluded. This is
a scope record, not a completion claim. Work directly without delegation. Use
substantive library readings and primary standards with edition, jurisdiction and
effective dates; read every mapped outline item on its actual page. Reconcile
company statements, adjustments, forecasts and decision constraints before
coverage promotion. Expansion will branch from the corrected PR #26 head and
be delivered in a new stacked draft PR.

